"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4991440","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3189970-1842846814450035","game_id":"steam-3189970","kind":"update","title":"BE QUICK! The Rise of Fraya: Demo Update","summary":"Demo update: a fifth boss and clearer combat The BE QUICK! The Rise of Fraya demo expands the tournament with a fifth boss, more cinematic variety, and improvements to how combat looks, sounds, and communicates each action. New content A fifth boss to test your reflexes and precision. Up to five defeat cinematics per boss, including the new one, bringing more variety to rematches. A closing cinematic hints at the next chapter of the story before the final thank-you message. Combat and abilities ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T01:27:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450035","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3189970-1840944183777286","game_id":"steam-3189970","kind":"update","title":"FRAYA’S ASCENSION: New Boss & Combat Precision Update!","summary":"The Hunt Intensifies! Hello, warriors of Fraya! 👋 We have been listening closely to your feedback from our latest playtests. To make Fraya’s ascent faster, fairer, and more fun, we are thrilled to announce a major update to the Demo! 👾 A New Challenge AwaitsThink you’ve mastered the demo? Think again! We have added a Brand-New Boss to the fray. Prepare to study its patterns and test your reflexes against this formidable enemy. It’s time to show what you’re made of! 🎯 Combat Precision & HUD Overh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T16:24:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183777286","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3189970-1840310314351898","game_id":"steam-3189970","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.15: Clearer Skills, More Precise QTEs, and Smoother Combat","summary":"v0.15: Clearer, More Precise, and More Satisfying Combat This update improves how every decision feels in combat: choosing a skill, hitting a target, keeping a streak alive, or moving into a new phase. Based on feedback from the community and creators who played BE QUICK! The Rise of Fraya, v0.15 focuses on three goals: making upgrades easier to understand, making QTEs more consistent, and strengthening visual combat feedback. Choose Upgrades with More Context The Stats & Skills system now featu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T16:00:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314351898","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3189970-1840310314347212","game_id":"steam-3189970","kind":"announcement","title":"A Clearer Experience in Every Battle","summary":"A Clearer Experience in Every Battle Warriors! We’re continuing to improve BE QUICK! The Rise of Fraya so every encounter feels precise and responsive, regardless of your screen size or resolution. Targets now adapt dynamically to different devices. We’ve also expanded the global leaderboards, allowing you to discover new rivals, explore more positions, and continue fighting for the fastest time. What’s New in This Update Targets now adapt to different screen sizes and resolutions. Improved targ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T10:44:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347212","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3189970-1840310314346097","game_id":"steam-3189970","kind":"announcement","title":"The BE QUICK! Demo Is Coming Soon!","summary":"The BE QUICK! demo is coming soon to Steam! Get ready to put your reflexes to the test in the opening battles of BE QUICK!, an action experience built around timing, precision, and split-second decisions under pressure. Three bosses. Three challenges. The demo includes the first three bosses from the full game: Varkhiel, the Bonebreaker — Your first challenge: learn to read the action and react before it is too late. Skaldur, Heart of Winter — A tougher enemy who demands focus and control. Vaelz","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T20:02:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314346097","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3189970-1839676055891129","game_id":"steam-3189970","kind":"announcement","title":"Your Playtest Access Is Ready — Play This Weekend","summary":"Your Playtest Access Is Ready If you requested access and were accepted, the Playtest is waiting in your Steam Library. We need just 10 minutes this weekend Launch BE QUICK! The Rise of Fraya Playtest from your Steam Library. Play until you defeat a boss—or until you feel like stopping. Tell us the exact moment you stopped or wanted to stop. What should you report? Was the opening easy to understand? Did the targets feel integrated into the cinematics? Did the difficulty feel fair? Did you encou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T17:17:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055891129","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3189970-1839676055887121","game_id":"steam-3189970","kind":"announcement","title":"BE QUICK! The Rise of Fraya Playtest Is Now Open","summary":"The first Playtest is now open! BE QUICK! The Rise of Fraya is ready for its first external testing round. We are starting with only 10 players so we can carefully review every report and improve the game before release. How to join Request access through the Steam Playtest button on the game's store page. Access will be granted to a small first group. If you are not selected this time, your request may be considered for future testing rounds. What feedback helps most? Bugs, crashes, or moments ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T04:58:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055887121","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3189970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3189970":"2026-10-26T10:16:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3189970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:55Z"},"4991440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:56Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3189970","app_id":3189970,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:12Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ae205a9f85f92e9e6c4a5651c6621877f507a3064af13be830c180413470b1da","response_sha256":null,"sourc